WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two targets appear in a fast stream. People sometimes identify the first and miss the second.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Researchers call that an attentional blink. In a later study, three months of intensive meditation

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
training changed performance on a similar task. That finding is interesting,

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
but it says nothing about whether a specific recording works in twelve minutes.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Here is a useful experiment you can run for free: choose one small task, work for twelve minutes without special audio,

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
and note what changed. Evidence first. Offers later.
